        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Normalize Person and Company Name"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1776277420497"
          },
          "code": "NORMALIZE_NAME",
          "id": "1775071496474",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1775071496477_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Task:\nNormalize person/individual and party/company name for restricted-party screening comparison.\n\nInput:\nFirst Name = {{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_SCREENING_FIELDS.$output.result.firstName}}\nLast Name = {{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_SCREENING_FIELDS.$output.result.lastName}}\nCompany Name = {{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_SCREENING_FIELDS.$output.result.companyName}}\nAlternate Name = {{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_SCREENING_FIELDS.$output.result.alternateName}}\n\nInstructions:\n- Convert to uppercase.\n- Remove punctuation.\n- Collapse extra spaces.\n- Expand common abbreviations such as TRDG, INTL, CO, etc.\n- Remove legal suffixes such as INC, PLC, LTD, LLC, CORP, etc.\n- Remove common honorifics such as MR, MRS, DR, PROF, SIR, SHEIKH, etc.\n- Normalize diacritical characters to their ASCII equivalents (e.g., Á → A, É → E, Ñ → N).\n- Preserve meaningful terms.\n- Do not add new words that are not supported by the input.\n\nReturn only valid JSON in this exact format:\n{\n  \"firstNameNormalized\": string | null,\n  \"lastNameNormalized\": string | null,\n  \"companyNameNormalized\": string | null,\n  \"alternateNameNormalized\": string | null\n}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"firstNameNormalized\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"lastNameNormalized\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"companyNameNormalized\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"alternateNameNormalized\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Normalize Address"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1776277420497"
          },
          "code": "NORMALIZE_ADDRESS",
          "id": "1775072533622",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1775072533623_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Task:\nStandardize the address for screening comparison.\n\nInput:\nAddress Line 1 = {{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_SCREENING_FIELDS.$output.result.addressLine1}}\nAddress Line 2 = {{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_SCREENING_FIELDS.$output.result.addressLine2}}\nAddress Line 3 = {{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_SCREENING_FIELDS.$output.result.addressLine3}}\nCity = {{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_SCREENING_FIELDS.$output.result.city}}\nProvince/State = {{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_SCREENING_FIELDS.$output.result.province}}\nPostal Code = {{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_SCREENING_FIELDS.$output.result.postalCode}}\nCountry = {{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_SCREENING_FIELDS.$output.result.country}}\n\nInstructions:\n- Convert to uppercase.\n- Normalize diacritical characters to their ASCII equivalents (e.g., Á → A, É → E, Ñ → N).\n- Expand common abbreviations such as RD, ST, AVE, BLVD, BLDG.\n- Remove filler words such as NEAR, OPP, ATTN, C/O when they do not add identity value.\n- Try to structure the address into components.\n- If the address is too vague, preserve partial values without guessing..\n- Do not infer a full address unless the evidence is strong.\n- If country is missing, infer only when there is strong evidence from the address.\n\nOutput JSON:\n{\n  \"normalizedAddressLine1\" : string | null,\n  \"normalizedAddressLine2\" : string | null,\n  \"normalizedAddressLine3\" : string | null,\n  \"normalizedCity\" : string | null,\n  \"normalizedProvince\" : string | null,\n  \"normalizedPostalCode\" : string | null,\n  \"normalizedCountry\" : string | null\n}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"normalizedAddressLine1\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"normalizedAddressLine2\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"normalizedAddressLine3\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"normalizedCity\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"normalizedProvince\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"normalizedPostalCode\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"normalizedCountry\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
